<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 145-2 V GLAMORGAN AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 145-2 V GLAMORGAN AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 145 for two at lunch on the opening day of a three-day match against Glamorgan on Wednesday.</p>
